<title>KENYA: CRICKET - KENYA V SOUTH AFRICA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - KENYA V SOUTH AFRICA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard of the South African innings in their one-day match against Kenya in the Kenyan centenary four-nation cricket tournament at the Nairobi Gymkhana Club on Thursday.</p>
<p>South Africa</p>
<p>    A.Hudson lbw b Onyango				27</p>
<p>    G.Kirsten c Chudasama b Karim		     66</p>
<p>    P.Symcox c Odoyo b Karim			    35</p>
<p>    H.Gibbs st Otieno b M.Odumbe			17</p>
<p>    J.Rhodes run out					54</p>
<p>    H.Cronje not out					63</p>
<p>    D.Crookes lbw b Odoyo				  1</p>
<p>    B.McMillan run out				     1</p>
<p>    D.Richardson run out				   3</p>
<p>    F.de Villiers not out				 20</p>
<p>    Extras (lb-5 nb-1 w-12)			     18	     </p>
<p>Total (for eight wickets in 50 overs)	  305</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-77 2-116 3-158 4-161 5-262 6-264 7-266 8-276.</p>
<p>Did not bat: A.Donald.</p>
<p>Bowling: M.Suji 9-0-47-0 (4-w), Odoyo 9-0-54-1 (1-nb), Onyango 3-0-45-1 (4-w), T.Suji 6-0-38-0 (2-w), Karim 10-0-44-2 (2-w), M.Odumbe 10-0-53-1, Tikolo 3-0-19-0.</p>
<p>Kenya: D.Chudasama, K.Otieno, S.Gupta, S.Tikolo, M.Odumbe, H.Modi, A.Karim, T.Suji, L.Onyango, T.Odoyo, M.Suji. (gone sport) Neil Manthorp in Nairobi - 254 2 744 348</p>
